{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"6a2d5a59-0cd5-4d03-89d3-7aa52bfe72fd","step":{"id":"s1","script":"At a boundary, light changes speed. Measure the incoming angle from the dashed normal, not from the surface.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Snell's law"},{"op":"figure","id":"boundary","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-3.5,3.5],"y":[-3.5,3.5],"axes":"none"},"marks":[{"kind":"segment","id":"surface","from":[-3.3,0],"to":[3.3,0]},{"kind":"point","id":"entry","at":[0,0]},{"kind":"segment","id":"normal","from":[0,-3.2],"to":[0,3.2],"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"text","at":[2.1,2.8],"text":"air: n₁ = 1"},{"kind":"text","at":[-1.9,-2.8],"text":"glass: n₂ = 1.5"},{"kind":"segment","id":"incoming","from":[-2.5,2.5],"to":{"at":"entry"},"arrow":true},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"entry"},"from":[0,3],"to":[-2.5,2.5],"r":0.24,"label":"θ₁"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"given","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"\\theta_1=45^\\circ,\\quad n_1=1,\\quad n_2=1.5"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"6a2d5a59-0cd5-4d03-89d3-7aa52bfe72fd","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Snell's law connects the angles and refractive indices. Entering higher-index glass, the ray bends toward the normal.","ops":[{"op":"equation","id":"snell","anchor":{"el":"given","side":"below","gap":0.12},"latex":"n_1\\sin\\theta_1=n_2\\sin\\theta_2"},{"op":"figure","id":"refracted","on":"boundary","marks":[{"kind":"segment","id":"outgoing","from":{"at":"entry"},"to":[1.603567,-3],"arrow":true},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"entry"},"from":[0,-3],"to":[1.603567,-3],"r":0.24,"label":"θ₂"},{"kind":"segment","from":{"at":"entry"},"to":[3,-3],"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"text","at":[2.65,-2.1],"text":"straight on","size":"small"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"6a2d5a59-0cd5-4d03-89d3-7aa52bfe72fd","step":{"id":"s3","script":"Dividing by the glass index gives a refracted angle of about twenty-eight degrees: smaller than forty-five degrees, just as the picture predicts.","ops":[{"op":"equation","id":"calculate","anchor":{"el":"snell","side":"below","gap":0.12},"latex":"\\sin\\theta_2=\\frac{1}{1.5}\\sin45^\\circ\\approx0.471"},{"op":"equation","id":"answer","anchor":{"el":"calculate","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"\\theta_2\\approx28.1^\\circ<45^\\circ"},{"op":"figure","id":"resultmark","on":"boundary","marks":[{"kind":"text","at":[0.85,-1.8],"text":"28.1°","size":"small"},{"kind":"text","at":[-1.1,1.9],"text":"45°","size":"small"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
